type: software
title: "Scaler Wizard: accessible model scaling workflows for Transformer Lab"
abstract: "Scaler Wizard is the implementation hub for Daniel Ramos' Multi-Vibe Code In Chain initiative to extend Transformer Lab with accessible model scaling workflows: LoRA adaptation, context extension with RoPE/NTK scaling, and knowledge distillation."
